# The WNPP/ITP bug a first Debian upload should close is filed as part of the
# maintainer-gated archive submission (mirrors packaging/debian's
# libasmtest-dev.lintian-overrides — see distribution-packaging.md T9 step 4), not
# in this in-tree CI build. Overriding keeps `make docker-syspkg-deb-desktop`
# lintian-clean without falsely claiming a bug number.
asmtest-desktop: initial-upload-closes-no-bugs
# A GUI application with no CLI surface (desktop/src/main.cpp takes no argv) has
# nothing a man(1) page would usefully document beyond the .desktop entry's own
# Comment/Keywords, which already serve that role in a GUI context.
asmtest-desktop: no-manual-page
